---
import Program from '../Program.astro';
const stages = ['Copied', 'Alongside', 'Extended', 'Record'];
---
<section class="split rv sand" id="path">
  <div class="l"><p class="eye">The path</p><h2 class="d2">Keep your DMS. <br>Fix the structure. <br><em>Decide the rest later.</em></h2>
    <p class="p" style="margin-top:28px;max-width:46ch">Lucio runs alongside your existing system through the same governed interface. If it earns a wider role, that's a later conversation with evidence in hand. If not, you keep everything, history intact. No notice period, no exit fee.</p></div>
  <div class="r">
    <Program title="Where most firms start" meta="One practice group, copied. Screens applied. Numbers reported." stages={stages} current={0} progress="14%" />
    <Program title="Where the evidence takes you" meta="Live next to your DMS for the matters you choose. Your system of record stays yours until you say otherwise." stages={stages} current={1} progress="40%" />
  </div>
</section>
